  "title": "A company purchases equipment for $150,000. The equipment has a useful…",
  "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"hw-prompt\">A company purchases equipment for $150,000. The equipment has a useful life of 10 years and no estimated residual value. Assuming straight-line depreciation, what annual depreciation expense should be recorded?</p>\n      <select data-correct=\"$15,000\"><option value=\"\">-- select --</option><option>$12,000</option><option>$15,000</option><option>$17,500</option><option>$150,000</option></select>",
  "notesHtml": "<ol><li>Annual depreciation = Cost ÷ Useful life = $150,000 ÷ 10 years = $15,000 per year.</li></ol><button class=\"answer-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Answer <span class=\"chev\">&#x2304;</span></button><div class=\"answer-reveal\"><ol><li>B. $15,000</li></ol></div>"
