  "notesHtml": "<ol><li>Annual depreciation = $280,000 ÷ 7 years = $40,000 per year. Over 3 years: 3 × $40,000 = $120,000 of accumulated depreciation.</li></ol><button class=\"answer-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Answer <span class=\"chev\">&#x2304;</span></button><div class=\"answer-reveal\"><ol><li>C. $120,000</li></ol></div>"
