  "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"hw-prompt\">A company reports service revenue of $500,000. Of this amount, $280,000 was earned on account and $220,000 was earned for cash. During the year, the company collected $82,000 of the receivables created from those credit sales. How much cash was collected from current-year services and receivables?</p>\n      <select data-correct=\"$302,000\"><option value=\"\">-- select --</option><option>$220,000</option><option>$302,000</option><option>$280,000</option><option>$420,000</option></select>",
