  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"callout\" style=\"margin-bottom:1em;\"><b>Referenced scenario (Question 36):</b> A company reports service revenue of $500,000. Of this amount, $280,000 was earned on account and $220,000 was earned for cash. During the year, the company collected $82,000 of the receivables created from those credit sales. How much cash was collected from current-year services and receivables?</div><p class=\"hw-prompt\">Using the information from Question 36, assuming no other activity, how much of the current-year service revenue remains in accounts receivable?</p>\n      <select data-correct=\"$198,000\"><option value=\"\">-- select --</option><option>$82,000</option><option>$138,000</option><option>$198,000</option><option>$280,000</option></select>",
