  "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"hw-prompt\">A company begins the year with $3.3 million of unearned membership revenue. During the year, it collects $5.9 million of membership fees in advance. At year-end, unearned membership revenue is $3.6 million. How much membership revenue was recognized during the year?</p>\n      <select data-correct=\"$5.6 million\"><option value=\"\">-- select --</option><option>$5.6 million</option><option>$5.9 million</option><option>$6.2 million</option><option>$8.9 million</option></select>",
